{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-03-04 12:53:00', 'title': "A WONDEROUS DEBUT: ROYAL CARIBBEAN'S WONDER OF THE SEAS SETS SAIL FROM US", 'text': "MIAMI, MARCH 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WONDER NO MORE, ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL'S\xa0HIGHLY ANTICIPATED SHIP, WONDER OF THE SEAS ,\xa0WELCOMES ITS FIRST GUESTS TODAY AS IT SETS COURSE FOR THE CARIBBEAN FROM PORT EVERGLADES IN FORT LAUDERDALE, FLORIDA. THE CRUISE LINE INVITES VACATIONERS OF ALL AGES ON BOARD THE WORLD'S LARGEST CRUISE SHIP TO EXPERIENCE THE ULTIMATE COMBINATION OF ALL-NEW ADVENTURES AND ROYAL CARIBBEAN FAVORITES DESIGNED TO INSPIRE WONDER AND AWE."}